                        <strong>Impact:</strong> Suspending <strong id="suspendUserName"></strong> will block authentication, revoke all active sessions, and restrict platform access.
                    </div>

                    <input type="hidden" id="suspendUserId" name="userId">

                    <div class="mb-3">
